 371:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** /***************************************************************************//**
 372:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****  *
 373:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****  * On startup, MSS supplied with 80MHz SCB clock
 374:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** 
 375:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   9.2  Power on procedure for the MSS PLL clock
 376:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** 
 377:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   During POR:
 378:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   Keep PLL in power down mode. powerdown_int_b=0
 379:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** 
 380:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   After POR, Power-On steps:
 381:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   1)  mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=0 & powerdown_int_b=0 & clk_standby_sel=0
 382:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   MSS PLL is powered down and selects clk_standby=scb_clk
 383:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   2)  PFC Processor writes powerdown_int_b=1 & divq0_int_en=1
 384:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   MSS PLL powers up, then lock asserts when locked.
 385:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   3)  PFC Processor switches mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=1
 386:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   MSS PLL clock is now sent to MSS.
 387:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   4)  When BOOT authentication is complete
 388:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   a.  PFC processor writes mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=0 to select clk_standby.
 389:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   b.  PFC Processor writes powerdown_int_b=0 to power down the PLL
 390:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   >>>>>>>> G5 Soc User code >>>>>>>>>>>>>>
 391:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   c.  MSS Processor writes new parameters to the MSS PLL
 392:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   5)  MSS Processor writes powerdown_int_b=1
 393:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   Start up the PLL with NEW parameters.
 394:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   Wait for LOCK
 395:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   6)  MSS Processor enables all 4 PLL outputs.
 396:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   7)  MSS Processor writes mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=1 to select the MSS PLL
